docs {
  HyperCore (Hyperliquid) gRPC block stream — the `streams.v1.BlockStream`
  service, served through Alchemy.

  **Endpoint:**
  - Mainnet: `https://hypercore-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/`

  **Auth:** send your Alchemy API key as gRPC metadata:
  `X-Token: <api_key>` (set `api_key` in your Bruno environment).

  **Protos:** the gateway does not expose server reflection, so the proto is
  bundled under `grpc/proto/`. The entrypoint is
  `grpc/proto/streams/v1/blocks.proto`.
}
